From bd52684498c61cac89c55eff20a3012f59f47f17 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Jouni Malinen <j@w1.fi>
Date: Sun, 24 Mar 2024 00:24:07 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] tests: Convert sigma_dut control to a context manager class

This cleans up the implementation and makes stopping of sigma_dut (and
cleanup after some parameters it might leave behind) more robust.

Signed-off-by: Jouni Malinen <j@w1.fi>
---
 tests/hwsim/test_sigma_dut.py | 3694 ++++++++++++++-------------------
 1 file changed, 1560 insertions(+), 2134 deletions(-)

